        {
          "title": "两",
          "content": "<p>个想法之间的差距越大，它们的结合就越具有原创性和令人惊讶性。</p>\n<p>-- <a href=\"https://thereader.mitpress.mit.edu/the-creativity-hack-no-one-told-you-about-read-the-obits/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">尤德·肯尼特</a>（Yoed Kenett），美国心理学家</p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "尤德·肯尼特",
              "url": "https://thereader.mitpress.mit.edu/the-creativity-hack-no-one-told-you-about-read-the-obits/"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "心",
          "content": "<p>甘情愿地接受限制，可以增强而不是抑制创造力。</p>\n<p>-- <a href=\"https://arun.is/blog/creative-power-constraints/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">《受约束的创造力》</a></p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "《受约束的创造力》",
              "url": "https://arun.is/blog/creative-power-constraints/"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "A",
          "content": "<p>I 研究的最终目的是，它编写我们不理解的程序，来解决我们不知道如何解决的问题。</p>\n<p>-- <a href=\"https://thenewstack.io/tla-creator-leslie-lamport-programmers-need-abstractions/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">莱斯利·兰波特</a>（Leslie Lamport），美国著名计算机科学家，排版系统 LaTex 的创始人</p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "莱斯利·兰波特",
              "url": "https://thenewstack.io/tla-creator-leslie-lamport-programmers-need-abstractions/"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "人",
          "content": "<p>们在夜晚和周末所做的事情，代表了世界上所有未充分利用的时间和精力。</p>\n<p>-- <a href=\"https://andrewchen.com/solve-a-hard-problem-cold-start-problem/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">安德鲁·陈《冷启动问题》</a></p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "安德鲁·陈《冷启动问题》",
              "url": "https://andrewchen.com/solve-a-hard-problem-cold-start-problem/"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
